  "affected_source_assessment": [
    "The sole product-body change includes both endpoints in JSON_Number finite-token full-consumption comparison, matching Producer_Values.Raw/Slice and the exact decimal parser span. Native_Number retains its complete token arena and original parser. Valid finite numeric leaves can reach the unchanged Integral/Floating branches; no false default Not_Numeric arises merely from excluding the terminal byte.",
    "All public specifications, Python_JSON_Equal member/container/order comparison, original finalization prefix checks and two original derived-field exemptions, bool/numeric coercion, nonfinite branches, decimal and binary64 contracts, accepted domains, tests, checked assertions, ABI and resource limits remain byte-exact. No numeric token/depth/magnitude cap or new permission appears.",
    "For a valid parsed Node, Raw requires positive First, ordered endpoints and Last within Data Length. The complete extent remains within the existing String/Count representation; malformed nodes still yield empty Slice and invalid native parse before this guard. This is static source reasoning; actual full RTE/flow/function/termination proof and high-index original controls remain required.",
    "Every manifest literal and effective contract pin was rederived using only isolated unchanged original normalizer definitions. Whole manifest differs only by the existing normalized Raw_JSON body digest; full required roster, original floor/policy and sole C boundary are unchanged. Registration changes only current manifest hash and one truthful current source-only provenance binding; historical Source16 binding is identical.",
    "Author actual composition and retained checker-only F67 inventory-schema refusal were verified from native protected-agent events. Source16 remains wholly identical. Actual prior isolated native refusal and concrete numeric defect justify this bounded correction experiment, without asserting the first rejected field, excluding another discrepancy or transferring the isolated exception to the unfinished original suite."
  ],
